00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:40.560
On fault dynamics, sediment records spanning 3,100 years show paired events.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.100
Earthquakes on the two systems occurred minutes to hours apart in some cases.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:49.740
