00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:54.200
Simultaneous activation would compound impacts on west coast cities.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.760
Ocean sediment layers captured the timing evidence across multiple cycles.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.960
The pattern suggests possible triggering between the two fault systems.

